WHY THIS ROUND EXISTED
  The face that decides whether six FAMILIES are green shipped at R2799 with
  eight criteria (AC-BSR1..AC-BSR8) and its own --check, and no row in
  src/sandbox/reconcile_all.py.  R2799 and R2800 both named the missing guard
  as the cheapest open debt: the grader was graded only by the run that
  rendered it.

WHAT LANDED
  src/os/test_battery_shard_report.py carries AC-BSRB1..AC-BSRB8, pinned in
  src/os/backlog.md BEFORE the file existed, each mapped one-to-one onto a
  tool criterion.  It never runs a real family: the machinery is driven
  through the real functions with synthetic runner streams in a private temp
  world, removed before the run ends.

